WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.942 --> 00:00:09.643
&gt;&gt; THE SENATOR OF THIS

00:00:09.677 --> 00:00:10.198
&gt;&gt; THE SENATOR OF THIS

00:00:10.232 --> 00:00:11.341
ADMINISTRATION, WE PUT FORTH

00:00:11.342 --> 00:00:13.303
$36 MILLION TO FIND A VACCINE

00:00:13.304 --> 00:00:15.575
AND WE ARE HOPEFUL TO FIND OUT

00:00:15.577 --> 00:00:18.708
BY THE END OF THE YEAR.

00:00:18.710 --> 00:00:20.316
THEY TURN DOWN BUREAUCRATIC

00:00:20.317 --> 00:00:22.198
BARRIERS TO PAVE THE WAY.

00:00:22.233 --> 00:00:24.016
&gt;&gt; OF THE TRUMP ADMINISTRATION

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:25.391
PUSHING TO FIND A CORONAVIRUS

00:00:25.392 --> 00:00:25.691
VACCINE.

00:00:25.726 --> 00:00:27.522
THE PRESIDENT PREDICTING THERE

00:00:27.557 --> 00:00:28.961
COULD BE A BREAKTHROUGH BY THE

00:00:28.962 --> 00:00:31.059
END OF THE YEAR.

00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:33.180
KRISTIN FISHER IS LIVE AT THE

00:00:33.181 --> 00:00:34.274
WHITE HOUSE.

00:00:34.275 --> 00:00:35.797
&gt;&gt; OVER THE WEEKEND

00:00:35.832 --> 00:00:36.957
PRESIDENT TRUMP SAID THAT HE

00:00:36.992 --> 00:00:39.579
BELIEVES THE UNITED STATES WILL

00:00:39.581 --> 00:00:41.355
HAVE A THERAPEUTIC AND OUTBOARD

00:00:41.356 --> 00:00:43.369
VACCINE FOR THE CORONAVIRUS LONG

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:45.710
BEFORE THE END OF THE YEAR.

00:00:45.711 --> 00:00:47.855
THE PERSON IN CHARGE OF THE

00:00:47.856 --> 00:00:50.408
AGENCY IS ESSENTIALLY THE PERSON

00:00:50.409 --> 00:00:51.903
THAT WOULD APPROVE THIS VACCINE.

00:00:51.905 --> 00:00:53.079
DR. STEPHEN HAWN.

00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:55.886
HE SAID IT’S VERY DIFFICULT IF

00:00:55.888 --> 00:00:57.691
NOT IMPOSSIBLE TO PUT A TIMELINE

00:00:57.692 --> 00:00:58.652
ON IT.

00:00:58.653 --> 00:01:00.709
&gt;&gt; I CAN’T PREDICT WHEN A

00:01:00.710 --> 00:01:02.042
VACCINE WILL BE AVAILABLE.

00:01:02.077 --> 00:01:03.160
OUR SOLEMN PROMISE TO THE

00:01:03.194 --> 00:01:05.661
AMERICAN PEOPLE IS THAT WE WILL

00:01:05.662 --> 00:01:07.893
MAKE A DECISION ON THE DATA AND

00:01:07.927 --> 00:01:08.944
SCIENCE OF THE VACCINE WITH

00:01:08.979 --> 00:01:12.260
RESPECT TO THE SAFETY AND

00:01:12.262 --> 00:01:13.779
EFFECTIVENESS OF THIS VACCINE.

00:01:13.781 --> 00:01:17.021
&gt;&gt; DR. HAHN WAS ASKED TO MAKE

00:01:17.022 --> 00:01:19.082
ANOTHER CLAIM OVER THE WEEKEND

00:01:19.084 --> 00:01:20.498
THAT 99% OF CORONAVIRUS CASES

00:01:20.499 --> 00:01:21.584
ARE HARMLESS.

00:01:21.585 --> 00:01:23.427
DR. HAHN DECLINED TO DO SO BUT

00:01:23.429 --> 00:01:27.503
THE WHITE HOUSE CHIEF OF STAFF

00:01:27.504 --> 00:01:29.641
DID THIS MORNING.

00:01:29.643 --> 00:01:32.731
&gt;&gt; I DON’T EVEN KNOW THAT IT’S A

00:01:32.766 --> 00:01:33.089
GENERALIZATION.

00:01:33.123 --> 00:01:35.639
WITH THE AMOUNT OF TESTING THAT

00:01:35.640 --> 00:01:37.434
WE HAVE COME THE VAST MAJORITY

00:01:37.435 --> 00:01:39.757
OF PEOPLE ARE SAFE FROM THIS.

00:01:39.791 --> 00:01:41.554
&gt;&gt; HAS A NUMBER OF CORONAVIRUS

00:01:41.588 --> 00:01:43.357
CASES CONTINUES TO SPIKE, THE

00:01:43.391 --> 00:01:45.056
RACE FOR THE VACCINE HAS BECOME

00:01:45.057 --> 00:01:46.050
INCREASINGLY URGENT.

00:01:46.051 --> 00:01:48.493
THE WHITE HOUSE IS BEEN LOOKING

00:01:48.527 --> 00:01:50.928
TO EXPEDITE A VACCINE UNDER

00:01:50.962 --> 00:01:52.207
OPERATION WARP SPEED BUT DESPITE

00:01:52.208 --> 00:01:54.272
THAT EFFORT DR. ANTHONY FAUCI

00:01:54.305 --> 00:01:56.414
SAYS IT WILL BE EARLY WINTER AT

00:01:56.415 --> 00:01:58.206
THE EARLIEST BEFORE IT IS KNOWN

00:01:58.207 --> 00:01:59.946
IF ANY VACCINES CURRENTLY IN

00:01:59.980 --> 00:02:02.355
DEVELOPMENT ARE SAFE AND

00:02:02.356 --> 00:02:02.747
EFFECTIVE.

00:02:02.781 --> 00:02:04.088
THIS MORNING CHIEF OF STAFF

00:02:04.122 --> 00:02:05.314
MARK MEADOWS ALSO SAID THAT

00:02:05.348 --> 00:02:06.563
PRESIDENT TRUMP WILL LIKELY BE

00:02:06.564 --> 00:02:08.021
ANNOUNCING SEVERAL EXECUTIVE

00:02:08.055 --> 00:02:09.695
ORDERS THIS WEEK ON IMMIGRATION,

00:02:09.730 --> 00:02:11.281
MANUFACTURING DRUGS,

00:02:11.316 --> 00:02:13.581
PRESCRIPTION DRUG PRICES AND

00:02:13.582 --> 00:02:13.819
CHINA.

00:02:13.854 --> 00:02:16.195
HE SAYS THAT, YOU KNOW, THE

00:02:16.196 --> 00:02:17.992
CONGRESS WILL TAKE THIS LONG

00:02:18.026 --> 00:02:20.734
BREAK OVER JULY AND THEN IT IS

00:02:20.769 --> 00:02:23.177
UP TO PRESIDENT TRUMP TO FIX

